int lowerBound(List<Integer> list, int target) {
    int lo = 0, hi = list.size();
    while (lo < hi) {
        int mid = (lo + hi) / 2;
        if (list.get(mid) < target) lo = mid + 1;
        else hi = mid;
    }
    return lo;
}
```

### 이분 탐색 풀이 동작 과정

```
